      "explanation": {
        "zh-Hant": "「ご予約」是預約，「お名前」是名字，「番号」是號碼。報上名字，或給櫃台看手機上的預約畫面。",
        "zh-Hans": "「ご予約」是预约，「お名前」是名字，「番号」是号码。报上名字，或给柜台看手机上的预约画面。",
        "en": "ご予約 is your booking, お名前 your name, and 番号 the number. Give your name or show the booking on your phone."
      },
      "wordIds": []
    },
    {
      "id": "car-rental.licence",
      "kind": "listening",
      "goal": {
        "zh-Hant": "聽懂櫃台請你出示駕照",
        "zh-Hans": "听懂柜台请你出示驾照",
        "en": "Understand when the counter asks for your driving licence"
      },
      "reviewNote": "駕照資格有法律後果：能否在日本開車依發照國不同（國際駕照、特定國家地區的駕照＋日文譯本等）。回應與解說不列國家清單，需熟悉日本道路交通法的人審稿。",
      "phrasings": [
        {
          "id": "car-rental.licence.p1",
          "role": "first",
          "speaker": "clerk",
          "text": "免許証を拝見してもよろしいですか？",
          "voice": "Aoede",
          "speed": "normal",
          "ambience": false,
          "screen": null,
          "audio": "car-rental.licence.p1.mp3"
        },
        {
          "id": "car-rental.licence.p2",
          "role": "review",
          "speaker": "clerk",
          "text": "国際免許証とパスポートをお願いします。",
          "voice": "Puck",
          "speed": "fast",
          "ambience": true,
          "screen": null,
          "audio": "car-rental.licence.p2.mp3"
        },
        {
          "id": "car-rental.licence.p3",
          "role": "review",
          "speaker": "clerk",
          "text": "免許証と翻訳文はお持ちですか？",
          "voice": "Kore",
          "speed": "normal",
          "ambience": false,
          "screen": null,
          "audio": "car-rental.licence.p3.mp3"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "a",
          "text": {
            "zh-Hant": "請出示駕照",
            "zh-Hans": "请出示驾照",
            "en": "Your driving licence, please"
          },
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "text": {
            "zh-Hant": "請出示信用卡",
            "zh-Hans": "请出示信用卡",
            "en": "Your credit card, please"
          },
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "text": {
            "zh-Hant": "請出示預約確認",
            "zh-Hans": "请出示预约确认",
            "en": "Your booking confirmation, please"
          },
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "response": {
        "ja": "はい、こちらです",
        "audio": "car-rental.licence.response.mp3",
        "voice": "Orus"
      },
      "explanation": {
        "zh-Hant": "「免許証」是駕照，「国際免許証」是國際駕照，「翻訳文」是日文譯本。要帶哪些文件才能在日本開車，依發照國家或地區不同，以官方公告和租車公司的說明為準。",
        "zh-Hans": "「免許証」是驾照，「国際免許証」是国际驾照，「翻訳文」是日文译本。要带哪些文件才能在日本开车，依发证国家或地区不同，以官方公告和租车公司的说明为准。",
        "en": "免許証 is a driving licence, 国際免許証 an international permit, and 翻訳文 a Japanese translation. Which documents you need to drive in Japan depends on where your licence was issued, so check the official notices and the rental company."
      },
      "wordIds": [
        "drivers-license",
        "international-driving-permit",
        "passport"
      ]
    },
