        "id": "main",
        "title": {
          "zh-Hant": "租一台車",
          "zh-Hans": "租一辆车",
          "en": "Picking up a rental car"
        },
        "intent": {
          "zh-Hant": "你在網路上訂了車，預約畫面存在手機裡，駕照和護照都帶著。只想加免責補償。沒有自己的 ETC 卡，這趟會走高速。3 號下午 5 點還車。",
          "zh-Hans": "你在网上订了车，预约页面存在手机里，驾照和护照都带着。只想加免责补偿。没有自己的 ETC 卡，这趟会走高速。3 号下午 5 点还车。",
          "en": "You booked a car online and have the booking on your phone, plus your licence and passport. You only want the damage waiver. You don't have an ETC card and will use the expressway. You'll return the car on the 3rd at 5 p.m."
        },
        "enter": {
          "zh-Hant": "走到租車櫃台",
          "zh-Hans": "走到租车柜台",
          "en": "Walk up to the rental counter"
